# White Ward is white, so it is protected from itself from the start, and "This effect doesn't remove this Aura"
# (CR 702.16n) is what keeps it on the creature. Its protection from white still removes other white Auras (CR 702.16c,
# 704.5m): Bot1's Devoted Hero wears Holy Strength (white) first; when White Ward resolves on it, state-based actions put
# Holy Strength into the graveyard and White Ward stays, with the Hero back to its printed size.

